- [x] I may have to update a few doc blocks still referring to dynamic scenes as mere container of entities, since they now include resources as well.
- [x] ~~I want to make the `resources` key optional, as specified in the Migration Guide, so that old scenes will be compatible with this change.~~ Since this would only be trivial for ron format, I think it might be better to consider it in a separate PR/discussion to figure out if it could be done for binary serialization too.
- [x] I suppose it might be a good idea to add a resources in the scene example so that users will quickly notice they can serialize resources just like entities.
